Placeholders
────────────────────────────────────────

A remote image is never fetched:

[image: Remote] https://example.com/logo.png — URL images
are never fetched

A path that escapes the collection:

[image: Escape] ../../README.md.png — outside the collection

A missing file:

[image: Missing] img/nope.png — file not found

An unsupported format:

[image: Vector] img/diagram.svg — unsupported image format


Inline
────────────────────────────────────────

An image inside a sentence [image: inline icon] stays
inline text.

• [image: In a list]

│ [image: In a quote]
slot line=13 20x4 small.png
slot line=20 60x8 wide.png
slot line=31 60x8 photo.jpg
slot line=43 16x30 tall.png
